  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "나의 대학에서 1학년과 2학년 때, 나는 많은 친구들을 사귀고 많은 클럽에 가입했습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "During my freshman and sophomore years in college, I made lots of friends and joined many clubs.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "다시 한 번, 나는 열심히 공부하는 것에 흥미가 없어졌습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Once again, I was not interested in studying very hard.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "고등학교를 다닐 때, 나의 꿈은 영어 선생님이 되는 것이었지만 나는 영어를 잘 하지 않는다는 것을 알았고 나는 그 꿈을 이루기 위해 열심히 공부하고 싶지 않았습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "When I was in high school, my dream was to be an English teacher,but I learned I was not very good at English, and I did not want to study hard enough to fulfill this dream.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "나는 나의 전공을 기술로 바꾸었고 그것이 정말로 좋았습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I changed my major to Engineering and really liked it.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "When I was in high school, my dream was to be an English teacher, but I learned I was not very good at English, and I did not want to study hard enough to fulfill this dream.",
